{#- EM2 approval email, HTML part (docs/spec/06 6.10; REQ-NOT-04). Autoescape on: every value is escaped. One CTA. -#}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<body style="margin:0;padding:24px;background:#f6f7f9;font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#1f2937">
<div style="max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;padding:24px">
<p>{{ company_name }} has approved your proposal "{{ title }}" and will contact you shortly to agree on pursuing the project.</p>
<p>Your contact: {{ contact_person_name }}, {{ contact_person_role }}, via {{ contact_channel }} before <strong>{{ contact_by_date }}</strong>.</p>
<p>This approval is an expression of interest, not a contract or a commitment to buy; nothing is binding until you both sign an agreement.</p>
<p>What happens next: first contact → NDA → agreement → implementation, all visible on your tracker.</p>
<p>Your disclosure record {{ receipt_id }} ({{ registered_at_eat }}) is attached to this engagement. {{ tier2_status }}</p>
<p>If nobody contacts you by {{ contact_by_date }}, we follow up with {{ company_name }} automatically.</p>
{%- if public_entity %}
<p>Public bodies may need to run a competitive process, and you may be asked to bid.</p>
{%- endif %}
<p><a href="{{ tracker_url }}" style="display:inline-block;background:#1d4ed8;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:6px">Open your tracker</a></p>
<p style="font-size:12px;color:#6b7280">Engagement ref {{ engagement_ref }}<br>
<a href="{{ notifications_url }}" style="color:#6b7280">Manage notifications</a> · <a href="{{ help_url }}" style="color:#6b7280">Help</a> · Nairobi, Kenya</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
